zfs-snapsync: zfs-snapsync (Unraid ZFS snapshot automation)
zfs-snapsync:
zfs-snapsync: Time-based and space-based ZFS snapshot lifecycle manager for Unraid.
zfs-snapsync: It keeps snapshots by age tiers, enforces pool free-space thresholds,
zfs-snapsync: and creates fresh snapshots for configured datasets.
